  "contradictions_and_limits": [
    "Section3.2 once labels the reference YPO4·H2O, butFigure4,Table2,SI S4 identify dihydrate; record retains mismatch.",
    "Source reports churchite amorphization at all tested temperatures up to473K and cannot determine its critical amorphization temperature before transformation; speculative repository-temperature benefits are not promoted.",
    "No quantitative recovery, criticality designation, industrial deployment or microbial mechanism is inferred.",
    "Handbook biochemical-weathering prose and earlier xenotime-concentrate churchite analogies do not establish a microbial species-level mechanism.",
    "The rhabdophane samples in this2026 study are Sm/Gd/Dy compositions; they do not resolve prior Ce/Nd microbial phase-assignment deferrals."
  ],
